-- One-off bulk import: adds well-known traditional dishes for every country/
-- territory in the countries reference table (scripts/countries_schema.sql)
-- that didn't already have a curated dish list. Run once in the Supabase
-- SQL Editor. Safe to re-run: the unique index on (country_id, name) plus
-- `on conflict do nothing` means already-present dishes are skipped, not
-- duplicated.
--
-- Prerequisite: the unique indexes from cuisine_meals_schema.sql must exist
-- (cuisine_meals_country_name_uidx). This file does NOT touch
-- catalog_highlights ("Son eklenenler") on purpose — see chat discussion,
-- bulk-adding thousands of rows there would flood the home screen feed.

on conflict (country_id, name) do nothing;
